{{also|Smoking}}
==English==

===Pronunciation===
*: {{rhymes|əʊkɪŋ}}

===Verb===
'''smoking'''

# {{present participle of|[[smoke]]}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|-}}

# The [[inhalation]] of [[tobacco]], or use substances.
#: ''Smoking is permitted.''
# The action of the verb '''to smoke''' in the sense of giving off smoke.
#: ''...the '''smoking''' remains of the fire.''

